title: mcp-agent-security-dojo
message: >-
  If you use this project in your research, teaching, talks, or
  consulting material, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Diogo
    family-names: Santos
repository-code: "https://github.com/dgenio/mcp-agent-security-dojo"
url: "https://github.com/dgenio/mcp-agent-security-dojo"
abstract: >-
  A hands-on security dojo for MCP-style and tool-using AI agents:
  reproduce common failure modes (prompt injection, tool poisoning,
  over-permissioned tools, unapproved side effects, context leakage,
  AI-generated auth-weakening diffs), then govern them with policy
  gates, bounded context, deterministic flows, capability scoping,
  and audit traces. Educational lab and reference architecture; not
  production-ready.
keywords:
  - MCP
  - AI agents
  - agent security
  - LLM security
  - prompt injection
  - tool use
  - policy-as-code
  - audit trail
  - defense-in-depth
